  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "KnightMate: Chess & Puzzles",
      "description": "KnightMate is the chess app that grows with you — whether you're learning your first opening or grinding toward master level. Play offline against a smart engine or challenge a friend. Then sharpen your edge with thousands of puzzles, deep analysis, and a built-in opening explorer.\n\nPLAY ANYONE, ANYTIME\n• Take on the computer across 20 finely tuned difficulty levels — from gentle beginner bots to a 2800+ grandmaster-strength engine.\n• Pass-and-play local matches on a single device.\n• Fully playable offline. No account required to start.\n\nSOLVE & IMPROVE\n• Thousands of hand-picked tactics puzzles, sorted by theme and difficulty.\n• A fresh Daily Puzzle every day — track your streak right from your Home Screen widget.\n• Train the key tactical patterns — forks, pins, and checkmates — until you spot them instantly.\n\nLEARN OPENINGS\n• A built-in opening explorer names every line as you play, with full ECO classification.\n• See exactly where you leave book and learn the ideas behind each opening.\n\nANALYZE YOUR GAMES\n• Engine analysis reviews any position and reveals the best moves.\n• Spot blunders, find missed wins, and understand why a move works.\n• Import and export games as PGN to study anywhere.\n\nMAKE IT YOURS\n• Beautiful board themes and classic piece sets (Alpha, Merida, Staunty, and more).\n• Satisfying move sounds and haptics.\n• Watch your rating climb and revisit every game in your history.\n\nKNIGHTMATE PRO\nUnlock the full experience with a single one-time purchase — no subscriptions:\n• Unlimited engine analysis.\n• Unlimited in-game engine hints.\n• Support independent development.\nFree players get a generous daily allowance to try everything.\n\nWhether you play one move a day or a hundred, KnightMate is your pocket chess companion — fun for beginners, deep enough for experts. Download free and make your move.",
      "releaseNotes": "What's new in KnightMate:\n• KnightMate is now on Apple Watch: play the computer and solve the Daily Puzzle on your wrist, with your games synced to your iPhone.\n• KnightMate is now on Apple TV: play the computer or a friend from the couch, solve the Daily Puzzle and review your games with the engine.\n• Bug fixes and improvements.",
